msgid ""
"The quantized model `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-w4a8-mtp` requires at least 2 Atlas "
"800I A3 (128GB × 8) nodes or 4 Atlas 800I A2 (64GB × 8) nodes. The Ascend "
"950DT mixed-deployment example uses 2 nodes (96GB × 8) with the original "
"Hugging Face weights. Run the following scripts on each node respectively."
msgstr ""
"量化模型 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-w4a8-mtp` 至少需要 2 个 Atlas 800I A3（128GB × 8）节点或 4 个 "
"Atlas 800I A2（64GB × 8）节点。Ascend 950DT 混合部署示例使用 2 个节点（96GB × 8）及原始 Hugging "
"Face 权重。请分别在各节点上运行以下脚本。"

msgid "=== \"950DT products with DSpark\""
msgstr "=== \"使用 DSpark 的 Ascend 950DT系列产品\""

msgid ""
"Use the original `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint on both nodes. Set "
"`node0_ip` to the service IP of Node0 on both nodes. Each node hosts one DP "
"rank whose 8 NPUs run prefill context parallel (PCP8), so the engine uses "
"`DP2/TP1` with `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`."
msgstr ""
"在两个节点上均使用原始 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` 检查点。在两个节点上均将 `node0_ip` 设置为 Node0 的服务 "
"IP。每个节点承载一个 DP rank，其 8 个 NPU 运行 prefill 上下文并行（PCP8），因此引擎使用 `DP2/TP1` 并设置 "
"`--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`。"

msgid ""
"Use the same environment variables as Node0, with the following DP changes "
"(start rank 1 and `--headless`):"
msgstr "使用与 Node0 相同的环境变量，并进行以下 DP 更改（起始 rank 为 1 且使用 `--headless`）："

msgid ""
"This section shows a deployment with one Prefill pool and one Decode pool on"
" Atlas 800I A3 (128GB × 8). The example uses two physical nodes for each "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"本节展示在 Atlas 800I A3（128GB × 8）上部署一个 Prefill 池和一个 Decode "
"池的示例。该示例为每个池使用两个物理节点。"

msgid ""
"This section shows a deployment with one Prefill pool and one Decode pool on"
" Atlas 800I A2 (64GB × 8). The example uses four physical nodes for each "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"本节展示在 Atlas 800I A2（64GB × 8）上部署一个 Prefill 池和一个 Decode 池的方案。该示例中每个池使用四个物理节点。"

msgid ""
"This section shows a 2P1D deployment on 8 Ascend 950DT nodes (96GB × 8) with"
" the `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint. The Prefill side (2P) runs 2 Prefill"
" instances, and each instance is a single logical engine with `DP1/TP1/PP2` "
"plus `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8` spread over 2 nodes (`--nnodes 2`):"
" one PP stage runs on each node. The Decode side (1D) uses 4 nodes as one "
"Decode pool containing 32 DP ranks with the `DP32/TP1` configuration, and "
"each Decode node starts 8 local DP ranks. Each Prefill instance declares "
"`\"prefill\": {\"dp_size\": 1, \"tp_size\": 1, \"pp_size\": 2, "
"\"pp_layer_partition\": \"32,29\"}` in `--kv-transfer-config`, while the "
"Decode side declares `\"decode\": {\"dp_size\": 32, \"tp_size\": 1}`. Assign"
" a unique `kv_port` to every Prefill instance and to the Decode pool."
msgstr ""
"本节展示在 8 个昇腾 950DT 节点（96GB × 8）上使用 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint 进行 2P1D "
"部署的方案。Prefill 侧（2P）运行 2 个 Prefill 实例，每个实例是一个单一的逻辑引擎，采用 `DP1/TP1/PP2` 加 "
"`--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`，分布在 2 个节点上（`--nnodes 2`）：每个节点运行一个 PP "
"stage。Decode 侧（1D）使用 4 个节点作为一个 Decode 池，包含 32 个 DP rank，采用 `DP32/TP1` 配置，每个 "
"Decode 节点启动 8 个本地 DP rank。每个 Prefill 实例在 `--kv-transfer-config` 中声明 "
"`\"prefill\": {\"dp_size\": 1, \"tp_size\": 1, \"pp_size\": 2, "
"\"pp_layer_partition\": \"32,29\"}`，而 Decode 侧声明 `\"decode\": {\"dp_size\": "
"32, \"tp_size\": 1}`。请为每个 Prefill 实例和 Decode 池分配唯一的 `kv_port`。"

msgid ""
"Before you start, set `nic_name` and `local_ip` in every script below to the"
" NIC name and IP address of the current node before starting the service."
msgstr "开始之前，请将下面每个脚本中的 `nic_name` 和 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的网卡名称和 IP 地址，然后再启动服务。"

msgid ""
"2. Prepare the Prefill startup scripts. There are 2 Prefill instances, and "
"each one is a PP2 engine spread across 2 nodes: the master node (`--node-"
"rank 0`) starts the engine and its API server, while the worker node "
"(`--node-rank 1`) joins the same engine with `--headless`. `--master-addr` "
"must point to the master node's service IP so that the worker can join the "
"cross-node process group, and both nodes must use identical model, TP, PP, "
"PCP, and `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` settings. `--port $1` takes the engine "
"port from the first command-line argument of the script, for example `bash "
"run_p_node0.sh 8000`."
msgstr ""
"2. 准备 Prefill 启动脚本。共有 2 个 Prefill 实例，每个实例是一个分布在 2 个节点上的 PP2 引擎：主节点（`--node-"
"rank 0`）启动引擎及其 API server，而工作节点（`--node-rank 1`）通过 `--headless` "
"加入同一个引擎。`--master-addr` 必须指向主节点的服务 "
"IP，以便工作节点能够加入跨节点进程组，并且两个节点必须使用相同的模型、TP、PP、PCP 和 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` "
"设置。`--port $1` 从脚本的第一个命令行参数获取引擎端口，例如 `bash run_p_node0.sh 8000`。"

msgid "1. `run_p_node0.sh` on the master node of Prefill instance 1:"
msgstr "1. Prefill 实例 1 主节点上的 `run_p_node0.sh`："

msgid ""
"2. `run_p_node1.sh` on the worker node of Prefill instance 1: use the same "
"content as Prefill node 0 with these changes: set `local_ip` to the IP of "
"this node, keep `node0_ip` as the master node's service IP, change `--node-"
"rank` to `1`, and append `--headless` to `vllm serve` so that this node runs"
" only its PP stage without starting an API server."
msgstr ""
"2. Prefill 实例 1 工作节点上的 `run_p_node1.sh`：使用与 Prefill 节点 0 相同的内容，但做以下修改：将 "
"`local_ip` 设置为本节点的 IP，保持 `node0_ip` 为主节点的服务 IP，将 `--node-rank` 改为 `1`，并在 "
"`vllm serve` 后追加 `--headless`，使该节点仅运行其 PP stage 而不启动 API server。"

msgid ""
"3. Prefill instance 2: prepare `run_p_node2.sh` (master node) and "
"`run_p_node3.sh` (worker node) the same way, with these changes: set "
"`local_ip` to the IP of each node, set `node0_ip` to this instance's own "
"master node IP, and assign a unique `kv_port`, for example "
"`\"kv_port\":\"30200\"`. Keep all other settings identical so that both "
"Prefill instances present the same `prefill` topology to the Decode pool."
msgstr ""
"3. Prefill 实例 2：以相同方式准备 `run_p_node2.sh`（主节点）和 "
"`run_p_node3.sh`（工作节点），但做以下修改：将 `local_ip` 设置为各节点的 IP，将 `node0_ip` "
"设置为此实例自己的主节点 IP，并分配唯一的 `kv_port`，例如 `\"kv_port\":\"30200\"`。保持所有其他设置一致，以便两个 "
"Prefill 实例向 Decode 池呈现相同的 `prefill` 拓扑。"

msgid ""
"4. Start the service. Set `local_ip` in every script to the IP of the "
"current node before starting. For each Prefill instance, start the master "
"node (`--node-rank 0`) before its worker node. The first argument is the "
"engine port passed to `--port $1`."
msgstr ""
"4. 启动服务。启动前，将每个脚本中的 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP。对于每个 Prefill 实例，先启动主节点（`--node-"
"rank 0`），再启动其工作节点。第一个参数是传递给 `--port $1` 的引擎端口。"

msgid "1. Prefill instance 1, master node:"
msgstr "1. Prefill 实例 1，主节点："

msgid "2. Prefill instance 1, worker node (headless):"
msgstr "2. Prefill 实例 1，工作节点（headless）："

msgid "3. Prefill instance 2, master node:"
msgstr "3. Prefill 实例 2，主节点："

msgid "4. Prefill instance 2, worker node (headless):"
msgstr "4. Prefill 实例 2，工作节点（headless）："

msgid "### 5.3 KV Cache Pool Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.3 KV Cache Pool 部署"

msgid ""
"This section provides PD separation deployments that add a KV Cache Pool for\n"
"cross-engine KV reuse. Each hardware series uses the pool backend that suits its\n"
"interconnect: the A3 series and 950DT products use the MemCache backend, and the\n"
"A2 series uses the Mooncake backend. Topology, connector roles, and pool settings\n"
"are explained in each hardware tab; apply only the settings for the selected platform."
msgstr ""
"本节提供在 PD 分离部署中增加 KV Cache Pool 以实现跨引擎 KV 复用的方案。每个硬件系列使用适合其互连的 pool 后端：A3 系列和"
" 950DT 产品使用 MemCache 后端，A2 系列使用 Mooncake 后端。拓扑、连接器角色和 pool "
"设置在各硬件标签页中说明；仅应用所选平台的设置。"

msgid "Select the tab that matches the deployment hardware."
msgstr "选择与部署硬件匹配的标签页。"

msgid "#### 950DT products {: #dsv4pro-5-3-950dt }"
msgstr "#### 950DT 产品 {: #dsv4pro-5-3-950dt }"

msgid ""
"This example uses the embedded LocalService mode: every vLLM process loads "
"`mmc-local.conf` from `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` and joins the pool itself, so "
"no standalone Memcache process is required. Before starting vLLM, install "
"`memfabric-hybrid` and `memcache-hybrid` and prepare the configuration files"
" below. For details, refer to the [Memcache backend "
"guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
"backend). All Prefill and Decode nodes must use the same MetaService "
"endpoint."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用嵌入式 LocalService 模式：每个 vLLM 进程从 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 加载 `mmc-"
"local.conf` 并自行加入 pool，因此无需独立的 Memcache 进程。在启动 vLLM 之前，请安装 `memfabric-"
"hybrid` 和 `memcache-hybrid` 并准备以下配置文件。详情请参考 [Memcache "
"后端指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
"backend)。所有 Prefill 和 Decode 节点必须使用相同的 MetaService 端点。"

msgid "##### Prepare the Memcache Services"
msgstr "##### 准备 Memcache 服务"

msgid "Create `mmc-meta.conf` on the node that runs MetaService:"
msgstr "在运行 MetaService 的节点上创建 `mmc-meta.conf`："

msgid ""
"Create `mmc-local.conf` on all Prefill and Decode nodes for the LocalService"
" embedded in vLLM:"
msgstr "在所有 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上为嵌入 vLLM 的 LocalService 创建 `mmc-local.conf`："

msgid ""
"Use `device_urma` for 950DT products Device UB; for UBOE, replace it with "
"`device_uboe`. `world_size` is the maximum number of LocalServices supported"
" by the pool, not the number of NPUs used by this example; changing it after"
" LocalServices connect requires restarting MetaService. `max.dram.size` must"
" be at least the largest `dram.size` contributed by any LocalService. "
"Because this example uses the embedded LocalService mode, `dram.size` must "
"be greater than `0GB`, and no standalone LocalService process is started."
msgstr ""
"950DT系列产品的 Device UB 使用 `device_urma`；对于 UBOE，请将其替换为 "
"`device_uboe`。`world_size` 是该池支持的最大 LocalService 数量，而不是本示例使用的 NPU 数量；在 "
"LocalService 连接后更改该值需要重启 MetaService。`max.dram.size` 必须至少大于等于任意 LocalService"
" 贡献的最大 `dram.size`。由于本示例使用嵌入式 LocalService 模式，`dram.size` 必须大于 "
"`0GB`，并且不会启动独立的 LocalService 进程。"

msgid "Start MetaService with `mmc-meta.conf`:"
msgstr "使用 `mmc-meta.conf` 启动 MetaService："

msgid ""
"The startup scripts below export `PYTHONHASHSEED=0` and "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`. `PYTHONHASHSEED=0` must match across all engines. "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` points to the absolute path of `mmc-local.conf`, for"
" example `/usr/local/python3.12.13/lib/python3.12/site-"
"packages/memcache_hybrid/config/mmc-local.conf`; change it to the actual "
"path in your environment."
msgstr ""
"以下启动脚本会导出 `PYTHONHASHSEED=0` 和 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`。所有引擎之间的 "
"`PYTHONHASHSEED=0` 必须保持一致。`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 指向 `mmc-local.conf` "
"的绝对路径，例如 `/usr/local/python3.12.13/lib/python3.12/site-"
"packages/memcache_hybrid/config/mmc-local.conf`；请将其更改为您环境中的实际路径。"

msgid "##### Prepare the Prefill Startup Scripts"
msgstr "##### 准备 Prefill 启动脚本"

msgid ""
"2. `run_p_node1.sh` on the worker node of Prefill instance 1: use the same "
"content as `run_p_node0.sh` with these changes: set `local_ip` to the IP of "
"this node, keep `node0_ip` as the master node's service IP, change `--node-"
"rank` to `1`, and append `--headless` to `vllm serve` so that this node runs"
" only its PP stage without starting an API server."
msgstr ""
"2. Prefill 实例 1 的 worker 节点上的 `run_p_node1.sh`：使用与 `run_p_node0.sh` "
"相同的内容，但进行以下更改：将 `local_ip` 设置为本节点的 IP，保持 `node0_ip` 为主节点的服务 IP，将 `--node-"
"rank` 更改为 `1`，并在 `vllm serve` 后追加 `--headless`，使该节点仅运行其 PP 阶段而不启动 API 服务器。"

msgid ""
"3. Prefill instance 2: prepare `run_p_node2.sh` (master node) and "
"`run_p_node3.sh` (worker node) the same way, with these changes: set "
"`local_ip` to the IP of each node, set `node0_ip` to this instance's own "
"master node IP, and assign a unique `kv_port` to the outer `MultiConnector` "
"and its `MooncakeConnectorV2` child, for example `\"kv_port\":\"30200\"`. "
"Keep all other settings identical so that both Prefill instances present the"
" same `prefill` topology to the Decode pool."
msgstr ""
"3. Prefill 实例 2：以相同方式准备 `run_p_node2.sh`（主节点）和 `run_p_node3.sh`（worker "
"节点），但进行以下更改：将 `local_ip` 设置为各节点的 IP，将 `node0_ip` 设置为此实例自身的主节点 IP，并为外层 "
"`MultiConnector` 及其 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 子连接器分配唯一的 `kv_port`，例如 "
"`\"kv_port\":\"30200\"`。保持所有其他设置相同，以便两个 Prefill 实例向 Decode 池呈现相同的 `prefill` "
"拓扑。"

msgid "##### Prepare the Decode Startup Script"
msgstr "##### 准备 Decode 启动脚本"

msgid "##### Startup and Verification"
msgstr "##### 启动与验证"

msgid ""
"Start the Memcache MetaService first, because every embedded LocalService "
"connects to it during engine startup. Prefill and Decode have no required "
"startup order relative to each other; wait until every engine reports "
"`Application startup complete` before deploying the proxy."
msgstr ""
"首先启动 Memcache MetaService，因为每个嵌入式 LocalService 在引擎启动期间都会连接到它。Prefill 和 "
"Decode 之间没有必需的启动顺序；请等待所有引擎报告 `Application startup complete` 后再部署代理。"

msgid ""
"1. Start MetaService on the node containing `mmc-meta.conf`. Wait until its "
"logs show that the Meta Service has launched."
msgstr "1. 在包含 `mmc-meta.conf` 的节点上启动 MetaService。等待其日志显示 Meta Service 已启动。"

msgid ""
"2. Prefill nodes. For each Prefill instance, start the master node (`--node-"
"rank 0`) before its worker node. The first argument is the engine port "
"passed to `--port $1`."
msgstr ""
"2. Prefill 节点。对于每个 Prefill 实例，先启动主节点（`--node-rank 0`），再启动其 worker "
"节点。第一个参数是传递给 `--port $1` 的引擎端口。"

msgid ""
"3. Decode nodes. Run each command from the directory containing "
"`launch_online_dp.py` and `run_dp_template.sh`:"
msgstr ""
"3. Decode 节点。在包含 `launch_online_dp.py` 和 `run_dp_template.sh` 的目录中运行每条命令："

msgid "1. Decode node 0"
msgstr "1. Decode 节点 0"

msgid "2. Decode node 1"
msgstr "2. Decode 节点 1"

msgid "3. Decode node 2"
msgstr "3. Decode 节点 2"

msgid "4. Decode node 3"
msgstr "4. Decode 节点 3"

msgid ""
"After the PD separation service is fully started, send a request through the"
" proxy to verify that Prefill and Decode nodes are working correctly "
"together. Then send the same request again to verify the KV Cache Pool: "
"check the Prefill logs for Memcache lookup, get, put, and cache-hit "
"activity, and confirm that Decode logs still show normal Prefill-to-Decode "
"KV transfer. An HTTP 200 response alone does not confirm pool reuse. For "
"details, refer to the [KV Cache Pool "
"guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
"backend)."
msgstr ""
"PD 分离服务完全启动后，通过代理发送请求以验证 Prefill 和 Decode 节点能否正确协同工作。然后再次发送相同的请求以验证 KV Cache"
" Pool：检查 Prefill 日志中的 Memcache 查找、获取、写入和缓存命中活动，并确认 Decode 日志仍显示正常的 Prefill 到"
" Decode 的 KV 传输。仅凭 HTTP 200 响应并不能确认池复用。有关详细信息，请参考 [KV Cache Pool "
"指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
"backend)。"

msgid "#### A3 series {: #dsv4pro-5-3-a3 }"
msgstr "#### Atlas A3系列产品 {: #dsv4pro-5-3-a3 }"

msgid ""
"Use the official `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8` checkpoint on all nodes. This example\n"
"    uses MRv2 and DSpark. Prefill enables layerwise Memcache access with\n"
"    `use_layerwise: true` and `layerwise_prefetch_layers: 3`; Decode uses\n"
"    `use_layerwise: false`."
msgstr ""
"在所有节点上使用官方 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8` checkpoint。本示例\n"
"    使用 MRv2 和 DSpark。Prefill 通过\n"
"    `use_layerwise: true` 和 `layerwise_prefetch_layers: 3` 启用分层 Memcache 访问；Decode 使用\n"
"    `use_layerwise: false`。"

msgid ""
"Before starting vLLM, follow the\n"
"    [Memcache backend guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
"    to install `memfabric-hybrid` and `memcache-hybrid`, configure\n"
"    `mmc-meta.conf`, `mmc-local.conf`, and `mmc-local-standalone.conf`, and start the\n"
"    Memcache MetaService. The\n"
"    Prefill and Decode nodes must use the same MetaService endpoint."
msgstr ""
"在启动 vLLM 之前，请按照\n"
"    [Memcache 后端指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
"    安装 `memfabric-hybrid` 和 `memcache-hybrid`，配置\n"
"    `mmc-meta.conf`、`mmc-local.conf` 和 `mmc-local-standalone.conf`，并启动\n"
"    Memcache MetaService。\n"
"    Prefill 和 Decode 节点必须使用相同的 MetaService 端点。"

msgid ""
"This example uses separated Memcache deployment so that the pool reserves host\n"
"    memory before vLLM loads the model. Prepare one MetaService configuration and\n"
"    two LocalService configurations as described below."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用分离式 Memcache 部署，以便该池在 vLLM 加载模型之前预留主机\n"
"    内存。请按下文所述准备一个 MetaService 配置和\n"
"    两个 LocalService 配置。"

msgid ""
"Create `mmc-local.conf` on all Prefill and Decode nodes for the LocalService\n"
"    embedded in vLLM:"
msgstr ""
"在所有 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上为嵌入在 vLLM 中的 LocalService\n"
"    创建 `mmc-local.conf`："

msgid ""
"Create `mmc-local-standalone.conf` on all four nodes for the standalone Memcache\n"
"    process. It uses the same endpoints, world size, and protocol, but contributes\n"
"    the host DRAM used by the pool:"
msgstr ""
"在所有四个节点上为独立 Memcache 进程创建 `mmc-local-standalone.conf`。它使用相同的端点、world size "
"和协议，但贡献的是供池使用的宿主 DRAM："

msgid ""
"`world_size` is the maximum number of LocalServices that can join the pool, not\n"
"    the DP size. Changing it after LocalServices connect requires restarting\n"
"    MetaService. `device_sdma` is recommended for A3 HCCS and requires LingQu\n"
"    Computing Network 1.5 or later. `max.dram.size` must be at least the largest\n"
"    `dram.size` contributed by any LocalService."
msgstr ""
"`world_size` 是能够加入池的 LocalService 的最大数量，而不是 DP 大小。在 LocalService 连接后修改它需要重启 "
"MetaService。对于 A3 HCCS 推荐使用 `device_sdma`，并且需要 LingQu Computing Network 1.5 "
"或更高版本。`max.dram.size` 必须至少是任何 LocalService 所贡献的最大 `dram.size`。"

msgid ""
"Each node runs one standalone LocalService initialized with `store.init(0)`.\n"
"    Its `120GB` DRAM contribution is per node, rather than per NPU.\n"
"    `ubsio.standalone.device_count = 1` matches this single DRAM-enabled process.\n"
"    The `600GB` configured by `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` is a separate host-memory pool\n"
"    for UBS IO, not the storage-device capacity. Reserve host memory for both\n"
"    allocations as well as the operating system and vLLM."
msgstr ""
"每个节点运行一个以 `store.init(0)` 初始化的独立 LocalService。其 `120GB` 的 DRAM "
"贡献是按节点计算的，而不是按 NPU 计算的。`ubsio.standalone.device_count = 1` 与此单个启用 DRAM "
"的进程相匹配。由 `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` 配置的 `600GB` 是供 UBS IO "
