msgid ""
"> `FC` reports the FlashComm1.\n"
">\n"
"> `DSA-CP (MRv1) / PCP (MRv2)` describes context parallelism according to the model runner version: MRv1 uses the `enable_dsa_cp` switch, while MRv2 uses `--prefill-context-parallel-size` to specify the PCP size. `PCP=8` means eight-way context parallelism; `PCP=1` means no context parallelism. For the long-context Prefill reference, enable FlashComm1 and disable context parallelism (`enable_dsa_cp: false` on MRv1, or PCP size `1` on MRv2). The long-context example for 950DT products runs on the V2 model runner and uses `PCP=8` on Prefill; `enable_dsa_cp` is mutually exclusive with PCP and must stay off there.\n"
">\n"
"> Fused MC2 is disabled in the long-context reference configuration because it increases memory usage. If sufficient memory is available and higher performance is the priority, enabling Fused MC2 on Prefill is recommended.\n"
">\n"
"> `--max-model-len 1048576` is the total context budget for prompt and generated tokens, not an additional output budget on top of a 1M-token prompt. Reduce `--max-num-seqs` or the actual input length if memory is insufficient.\n"
">\n"
"> For complete startup commands and parameter descriptions, please refer to the deployment examples in [Chapter 5](#5-online-service-deployment)."
msgstr ""
"> `FC` 表示 FlashComm1。\n"
">\n"
"> `DSA-CP (MRv1) / PCP (MRv2)` 根据模型运行器版本描述上下文并行：MRv1 使用 `enable_dsa_cp` 开关，而 MRv2 使用 `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 指定 PCP 大小。`PCP=8` 表示八路上下文并行；`PCP=1` 表示无上下文并行。对于长上下文 Prefill 参考配置，启用 FlashComm1 并禁用上下文并行（MRv1 上设置 `enable_dsa_cp: false`，或 MRv2 上 PCP 大小为 `1`）。950DT 系列产品的长上下文示例运行在 V2 模型运行器上，并在 Prefill 上使用 `PCP=8`；`enable_dsa_cp` 与 PCP 互斥，此处必须保持关闭。\n"
">\n"
"> 长上下文参考配置中禁用了 Fused MC2，因为它会增加内存使用量。如果内存充足且优先考虑更高性能，建议在 Prefill 上启用 Fused MC2。\n"
">\n"
"> `--max-model-len 1048576` 是提示词和生成 token 的总上下文预算，而不是在 1M token 提示词之上的额外输出预算。如果内存不足，请减少 `--max-num-seqs` 或实际输入长度。\n"
">\n"
"> 完整的启动命令和参数说明，请参考 [第 5 章](#5-online-service-deployment) 中的部署示例。"

msgid ""
"A: For 950PR&950DT products, the W4A4C8 weights of `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` "
"are quantized with "
"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_pro_w4a4c8.yaml)."
" To preserve accuracy at such a low bit-width, a mixed-precision strategy is"
" used: only the modules that dominate the parameter count are quantized to 4"
" bit, while precision-sensitive modules fall back to higher precision or are"
" not quantized at all."
msgstr ""
"答：对于 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品，`DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` 的 W4A4C8 权重使用 "
"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_pro_w4a4c8.yaml)"
" 进行量化。为了在如此低的位宽下保持精度，采用了混合精度策略：仅将参数数量占主导的模块量化为 4 bit，而对精度敏感的模块回退到更高精度或完全不量化。"

msgid ""
"- **Quantization algorithm**: The weights and activations use the MXFP4/MXFP8 microscaling formats. Each tensor is divided into blocks of 32 elements, and each block shares a single scaling factor obtained with symmetric min-max calibration on a mixed calibration dataset. Block-wise scaling adapts to the local dynamic range of each tensor, so the quantization error is far lower than that of uniform INT4 quantization.\n"
"- **C8 (FP8 KV cache)**: C8 is a dynamic quantization applied to the KV cache during inference. On 950PR&950DT products, the KV cache is quantized to FP8 (not INT8). It is unrelated to the parameters stored in the weight checkpoint and is controlled only by the serving configuration. DeepSeek-V4-Flash and DeepSeek-V4-Pro share exactly the same C8 scheme:\n"
"    - **Attention KV cache** (FP8 by default on 950PR&950DT products; switch back to BF16 with `--kv-cache-dtype bfloat16`): the compressed KV latent, which serves as both K and V, is dynamically quantized per 64-element tile to FP8 (E4M3) with a shared E8M0 scale per tile; the RoPE part of the KV cache stays in BF16, and Q is not quantized.\n"
"    - **Indexer cache** (enabled with `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`): both indexer Q and K are first rotated by a Hadamard matrix to spread outliers, and then dynamically quantized per token to FP8 (E4M3) with per-token FP32 scales."
msgstr ""
"- **量化算法**：权重和激活值采用 MXFP4/MXFP8 微缩放格式。每个张量被划分为 32 个元素的块，每个块共享一个缩放因子，该因子通过在混合校准数据集上进行对称 min-max 校准获得。分块缩放能够适应每个张量的局部动态范围，因此量化误差远低于均匀 INT4 量化。\n"
"- **C8（FP8 KV cache）**：C8 是在推理过程中应用于 KV cache 的动态量化。在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 上，KV cache 被量化为 FP8（而非 INT8）。它与权重 checkpoint 中存储的参数无关，仅由服务配置控制。DeepSeek-V4-Flash 和 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 共享完全相同的 C8 方案：\n"
"    - **Attention KV cache**（在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 上默认为 FP8；可通过 `--kv-cache-dtype bfloat16` 切换回 BF16）：作为 K 和 V 的压缩 KV latent，按 64 元素 tile 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），每个 tile 共享一个 E8M0 缩放因子；KV cache 的 RoPE 部分保持 BF16，Q 不量化。\n"
"    - **Indexer cache**（通过 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 启用）：indexer 的 Q 和 K 首先通过 Hadamard 矩阵旋转以分散离群值，然后按 token 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），每个 token 使用 FP32 缩放因子。"

msgid ""
"- `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8` (Official release with DSpark after "
"quantization): This checkpoint includes the DSpark draft weights, so no "
"separate draft-model path is required."
msgstr ""
"- `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8`（量化后包含 DSpark 的官方发布版本）：该权重文件已包含 DSpark "
"草稿权重，因此无需单独指定草稿模型路径。"

