"and is provided in [Common Script and Parameter "
"Descriptions](#dsv4pro-5-2-common)."
msgstr ""
"1. 在每个 Decode 节点上准备脚本 `launch_online_dp.py`。Prefill 引擎由 Prefill 节点上的 `vllm "
"serve` "
"直接启动，因此那里不需要该脚本。该启动脚本由所有硬件标签页共用，并在[公共脚本与参数说明](#dsv4pro-5-2-common)中提供。"

msgid ""
"3. Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on each Decode node. `launch_online_dp.py` "
"passes the visible devices, port, DP size, DP rank, DP address, DP RPC port,"
" TP size, and PCP size as `$1` through `$8`; this template ignores `$8` "
"because Decode engines do not use PCP."
msgstr ""
"3. 在每个 Decode 节点上准备 `run_dp_template.sh`。`launch_online_dp.py` 会将可见设备、端口、DP "
"大小、DP rank、DP 地址、DP RPC 端口、TP 大小和 PCP 大小作为 `$1` 到 `$8` 传入；该模板会忽略 `$8`，因为 "
"Decode 引擎不使用 PCP。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) and "
"register all Prefill and Decode engine endpoints started above. Each Prefill"
" instance exposed one API server on port `8000` of its master node, and each"
" Decode node exposes ports `8000` through `8007`. Use the DP master address "
"(`--dp-address` above, e.g. `xx.xx.xx.5`) as the IP of Decode node 0."
msgstr ""
"请参考 [Prefill-Decode "
"分离（Deepseek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)，并注册上面启动的所有"
" Prefill 和 Decode 引擎端点。每个 Prefill 实例在其主节点的 `8000` 端口上暴露一个 API 服务器，每个 Decode "
"节点暴露 `8000` 到 `8007` 端口。请将 DP 主地址（上面的 `--dp-address`，例如 `xx.xx.xx.5`）用作 "
"Decode 节点 0 的 IP。"

msgid ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` sets the KV cache dtype to FP8, and `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` sets the index-side KV dtype to FP8. The P and D sides must use the same KV data types so that the transferred KV cache is directly reusable.\n"
"    - `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank` / `--master-addr` distribute each Prefill engine (`DP1/TP1/PP2`) over 2 nodes with one PP stage per node; the worker node (`--node-rank 1`) runs headless, and `--master-addr` is the service IP of the instance's master node for the cross-node process group.\n"
"    - `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"32,29\"` partitions the 61 target layers across the 2 PP stages; the same partition must be declared in `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.pp_layer_partition`.\n"
"    - `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8` spreads the prompt across the 8 NPUs of each PP stage.\n"
"    - `--kv-transfer-config` uses `MooncakeConnectorV2` for KV transfer; it is required because pipeline parallelism is enabled.\n"
"    - `--additional-config`: `enable_fused_mc2: 0` disables Fused MC2 and instead overlaps shared-expert computation with MoE communication via `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true`, with `enable_shared_expert_dp: true` placing shared experts on DP ranks; `combine_quant_mode: 4` forces the MoE MC2 combine stage on Decode nodes to use FP8 (MXFP float8_e4m3) communication quantization."
msgstr ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` 将 KV cache 的数据类型设置为 FP8，`--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 将索引侧 KV 的数据类型设置为 FP8。P 侧和 D 侧必须使用相同的 KV 数据类型，以便传输的 KV cache 可以直接复用。\n"
"    - `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank` / `--master-addr` 将每个 Prefill 引擎（`DP1/TP1/PP2`）分布到 2 个节点上，每个节点一个 PP 阶段；工作节点（`--node-rank 1`）以无头模式运行，`--master-addr` 是该实例主节点的服务 IP，用于跨节点进程组。\n"
"    - `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"32,29\"` 将 61 个目标层划分到 2 个 PP 阶段；必须在 `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.pp_layer_partition` 中声明相同的划分。\n"
"    - `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8` 将 prompt 分散到每个 PP 阶段的 8 个 NPU 上。\n"
"    - `--kv-transfer-config` 使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 进行 KV 传输；由于启用了流水线并行，因此该项是必需的。\n"
"    - `--additional-config`：`enable_fused_mc2: 0` 禁用 Fused MC2，改为通过 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` 将共享专家计算与 MoE 通信重叠，并通过 `enable_shared_expert_dp: true` 将共享专家放置在 DP rank 上；`combine_quant_mode: 4` 强制 Decode 节点上的 MoE MC2 combine 阶段使用 FP8（MXFP float8_e4m3）通信量化。"

msgid "#### A3 series {: #dsv4pro-5-2-a3 }"
msgstr "#### A3 系列 {: #dsv4pro-5-2-a3 }"

msgid ""
"1. Prepare `launch_online_dp.py` on each Decode node. The launcher is shared"
" by all hardware tabs and is provided in [Common Script and Parameter "
"Descriptions](#dsv4pro-5-2-common)."
msgstr ""
"1. 在每个 Decode 节点上准备 "
"`launch_online_dp.py`。该启动脚本由所有硬件标签页共用，并在[公共脚本与参数说明](#dsv4pro-5-2-common)中提供。"

msgid "#### A2 series {: #dsv4pro-5-2-a2 }"
msgstr "#### A2 系列 {: #dsv4pro-5-2-a2 }"

msgid ""
"1. Prepare the script `launch_online_dp.py` on each node. The launcher is "
"shared by all hardware tabs and is provided in [Common Script and Parameter "
"Descriptions](#dsv4pro-5-2-common)."
msgstr ""
"1. 在每个节点上准备脚本 "
"`launch_online_dp.py`。该启动脚本由所有硬件标签页共用，并在[公共脚本与参数说明](#dsv4pro-5-2-common)中提供。"

msgid ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype` keeps the default BF16 KV dtype, and `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` sets the index-side KV dtype to INT8. The P and D sides must use the same KV data types so that the transferred KV cache is directly reusable.\n"
"    - `--kv-transfer-config` uses `MooncakeHybridConnector` for KV transfer because pipeline parallelism is not enabled.\n"
"    - `--additional-config`: `enable_flashcomm1: true` and `enable_fused_mc2: 1` enable the Fused MC2 fusion operator with FlashComm; the Prefill nodes additionally set `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`.\n"
"    - No `--prefill-context-parallel-size`: PCP is not used because each DP rank already runs full `TP8`."
msgstr ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype` 保持默认的 BF16 KV 数据类型，`--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` 将索引侧 KV 的数据类型设置为 INT8。P 侧和 D 侧必须使用相同的 KV 数据类型，以便传输的 KV cache 可以直接复用。\n"
"    - `--kv-transfer-config` 使用 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 进行 KV 传输，因为未启用流水线并行。\n"
"    - `--additional-config`：`enable_flashcomm1: true` 和 `enable_fused_mc2: 1` 启用结合 FlashComm 的 Fused MC2 融合算子；Prefill 节点还额外设置 `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`。\n"
"    - 不使用 `--prefill-context-parallel-size`：因为每个 DP rank 已经运行完整的 `TP8`，所以不使用 PCP。"

msgid "**Common key parameter descriptions**"
msgstr "**公共关键参数说明**"

msgid ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the service may OOM during startup.\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on prefill nodes instead of graph compilation.\n"
"- `--trust-remote-code` allows the model repository's custom code to be loaded. Only use trusted model repositories.\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` configures KV cache transfer between the prefill producer and decode consumer in PD separation.\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and `decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual parallel layout on the prefill and decode sides.\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true`: enables the recomputation scheduler. When the KV Cache of the Decode node is insufficient, requests are sent to Prefill for KV Cache recomputation. Enable it only on PD Decode nodes; the legacy top-level key is deprecated.\n"
"- `--speculative-config`: Prefill and Decode must use the same DSpark `num_speculative_tokens` value. Use the value declared by the checkpoint; the 950DT and A3 examples use `5`, while the A2 example uses `7`. The nested `enforce_eager` applies to DSpark draft execution, while the top-level `--enforce-eager` keeps the Prefill target model in eager mode.\n"
"- `ascend_compilation_config.enable_npugraph_ex: true` enables the extended NPU graph mode on Decode for graph compilation (Prefill runs eager mode instead); `enable_static_kernel: false` keeps dynamic-shape kernels instead of static-shape kernels for aclgraph execution.\n"
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` configures prefill context parallelism (PCP) on Model Runner V2 (MRv2), replacing the DSA-CP configuration used on MRv1. Besides speeding up long-context prefill, enabling PCP also shards the o_proj weights across the PCP group, providing partial tensor parallelism even when `--tensor-parallel-size` is `1` and relieving memory pressure. Each hardware tab configures PCP differently; see the tab-specific descriptions.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W4A8 model used in the A2 and A3 configurations. The original DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 weights used on 950DT products do not require this option."
msgstr ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV cache 管理器启用。DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool 部署需要此标志；否则服务可能在启动时发生 OOM。\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` 强制 prefill 节点使用 eager 执行而非图编译。\n"
"- `--trust-remote-code` 允许加载模型仓库中的自定义代码。请仅使用可信的模型仓库。\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` 配置 PD 分离中 prefill 生产者与 decode 消费者之间的 KV cache 传输。\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 `decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与 prefill 侧和 decode 侧的实际并行布局一致。\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true`：启用重计算调度器。当 Decode 节点的 KV Cache 不足时，请求会被发送到 Prefill 进行 KV Cache 重计算。仅在 PD Decode 节点上启用；旧的顶层键已弃用。\n"
"- `--speculative-config`：Prefill 和 Decode 必须使用相同的 DSpark `num_speculative_tokens` 值。请使用 checkpoint 声明的值；950DT 和 A3 示例使用 `5`，而 A2 示例使用 `7`。嵌套的 `enforce_eager` 作用于 DSpark draft 执行，而顶层的 `--enforce-eager` 使 Prefill 目标模型保持 eager 模式。\n"
"- `ascend_compilation_config.enable_npugraph_ex: true` 在 Decode 上启用扩展 NPU 图模式以进行图编译（Prefill 则运行 eager 模式）；`enable_static_kernel: false` 保持动态 shape kernel 而非静态 shape kernel 用于 aclgraph 执行。\n"
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 在 Model Runner V2 (MRv2) 上配置 prefill 上下文并行 (PCP)，替代 MRv1 上使用的 DSA-CP 配置。启用 PCP 除了加速长上下文 prefill 外，还会在 PCP 组内对 o_proj 权重进行分片，即使 `--tensor-parallel-size` 为 `1` 也能提供部分张量并行，从而缓解内存压力。每种硬件标签页配置 PCP 的方式不同；请参阅各标签页的说明。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` 为 A2 和 A3 配置中使用的 W4A8 模型启用昇腾量化。950DT 系列产品上使用的原始 DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 权重不需要此选项。"

msgid ""
"The hardware-specific parameter differences are listed inside each tab "
"above."
msgstr "各硬件的参数差异列在上方各标签页中。"

msgid "<a id=\"dsv4pro-5-2-common\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"dsv4pro-5-2-common\"></a>"

msgid "**Common Script and Parameter Descriptions**"
msgstr "**通用脚本与参数说明**"

msgid ""
"The three hardware tabs above share the same `launch_online_dp.py` launcher,"
" shown below. Every local DP instance occupies `TP × PCP` NPUs; when `--pcp-"
"size` is not specified, PCP defaults to `1`."
msgstr ""
"上方三个硬件标签页共用同一个 `launch_online_dp.py` 启动器，如下所示。每个本地 DP 实例占用 `TP × PCP` 个 "
"NPU；未指定 `--pcp-size` 时，PCP 默认为 `1`。"

msgid "Parameter descriptions of `launch_online_dp.py`:"
msgstr "`launch_online_dp.py` 的参数说明："

msgid ""
"|`--dp-size`|int|Yes|-|Data parallel size (total number of DP ranks across "
"all nodes).|"
msgstr "|`--dp-size`|int|是|-|数据并行大小（所有节点上的 DP rank 总数）。|"

msgid "|`--tp-size`|int|No|1|Tensor parallel size within each DP rank.|"
msgstr "|`--tp-size`|int|否|1|每个 DP rank 内的张量并行大小。|"

msgid ""
"|`--pcp-size`|int|No|1|Prefill context parallel size within each DP rank; "
"passed as `$8` / `PCP_SIZE` to `run_dp_template.sh`. Each local DP instance "
"uses `TP × PCP` devices.|"
msgstr ""
"|`--pcp-size`|int|否|1|每个 DP rank 内的 prefill 上下文并行大小；作为 `$8` / `PCP_SIZE` 传递给"
" `run_dp_template.sh`。每个本地 DP 实例使用 `TP × PCP` 个设备。|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-size-local`|int|No|(same as `--dp-size`)|Number of DP ranks on the "
"current node. If not set, defaults to `--dp-size`.|"
msgstr ""
"|`--dp-size-local`|int|否|（与 `--dp-size` 相同）|当前节点上的 DP rank 数量。若未设置，则默认为 "
"`--dp-size`。|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-rank-start`|int|Yes|-|Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks on"
" this node.|"
msgstr "|`--dp-rank-start`|int|是|-|此节点上数据并行 rank 的起始 rank 偏移。|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-address`|str|Yes|-|IP address of the data parallel master node.|"
msgstr "|`--dp-address`|str|是|-|数据并行主节点的 IP 地址。|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-rpc-port`|str|No|12321|RPC port for data parallel master "
"communication.|"
msgstr "|`--dp-rpc-port`|str|否|12321|数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。|"

msgid ""
"|`--vllm-start-port`|int|No|8000|Starting port for each vLLM engine instance"
" on this node.|"
msgstr "|`--vllm-start-port`|int|否|8000|此节点上每个 vLLM 引擎实例的起始端口。|"

msgid ""
"After the PD separation service is fully started and every engine reports "
"`Application startup complete`, send a request through the proxy port on the"
" prefill master node to verify that Prefill and Decode nodes are working "
"correctly together. Refer to [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for the "
"proxy verification method."
msgstr ""
"PD 分离服务完全启动且每个引擎都报告 `Application startup complete` 后，通过 prefill "
"主节点上的代理端口发送请求，以验证 Prefill 和 Decode 节点能否正确协同工作。代理验证方法请参阅 [Prefill-Decode "
"分离（Deepseek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

msgid ""
"This section extends the 2P1D deployment of [Section "
"5.2](#dsv4pro-5-2-950dt) with a Memcache KV Cache Pool on the same 8 Ascend "
"950DT nodes (96GB × 8) and the `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint. "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2` still transfers KV cache from Prefill to Decode, while"
" `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV cache in Memcache so that "
"requests sharing a prefix can skip Prefill recomputation. Both connectors "
"are configured as children of `MultiConnector`. Prefill enables layerwise "
"Memcache access with `use_layerwise: true` and `layerwise_prefetch_layers: "
"3`; Decode uses the default non-layerwise mode."
msgstr ""
"本节在 [5.2 节](#dsv4pro-5-2-950dt) 的 2P1D 部署基础上，在相同的 8 个 Ascend 950DT 节点（96GB ×"
" 8）上使用 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint 扩展了 Memcache KV Cache "
"Pool。`MooncakeConnectorV2` 仍负责将 KV cache 从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，而 "
"`AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV cache 存储到 Memcache 中，使共享前缀的请求可以跳过 Prefill "
"重计算。两个连接器都配置为 `MultiConnector` 的子连接器。Prefill 通过 `use_layerwise: true` 和 "
"`layerwise_prefetch_layers: 3` 启用分层 Memcache 访问；Decode 使用默认的非分层模式。"

msgid ""
"Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` from [Section 5.2](#dsv4pro-5-2-950dt) on the "
"Decode nodes. The Prefill engines are still started directly by `vllm "
"serve`, with the environment variables and `MultiConnector` configuration "
"required by the pool."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 节点上复用 [5.2 节](#dsv4pro-5-2-950dt) 中的 `launch_online_dp.py`。Prefill "
"引擎仍由 `vllm serve` 直接启动，并使用该池所需的环境变量和 `MultiConnector` 配置。"

msgid ""
"Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on each Decode node. Compared with [Section "
"5.2](#dsv4pro-5-2-950dt), only the Memcache environment variables and `--kv-"
"transfer-config` change; `launch_online_dp.py` still passes the visible "
"devices, port, DP size, DP rank, DP address, DP RPC port, TP size, and PCP "
"size as `$1` through `$8`."
msgstr ""
"在每个 Decode 节点上准备 `run_dp_template.sh`。与 [5.2 节](#dsv4pro-5-2-950dt) 相比，只有 "
"Memcache 环境变量和 `--kv-transfer-config` 发生变化；`launch_online_dp.py` "
"仍将可见设备、端口、DP 大小、DP rank、DP 地址、DP RPC 端口、TP 大小和 PCP 大小作为 `$1` 到 `$8` 传递。"

msgid ""
"4. Deploy the P-D disaggregation proxy. Refer to [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) and "
"register all Prefill and Decode engine endpoints started above, the same way"
" as [Section 5.2](#dsv4pro-5-2-950dt)."
msgstr ""
"4. 部署 P-D 分离代理。请参阅 [Prefill-Decode "
"分离（Deepseek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)，并按照与 "
"[5.2 节](#dsv4pro-5-2-950dt) 相同的方式注册上面启动的所有 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎端点。"

msgid ""
"This configuration extends the Atlas 800I A3 deployment in [Section 5.2](#dsv4pro-5-2-a3) with a\n"
"    Memcache KV Cache Pool. `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache from Prefill to\n"
"    Decode and supports the pipeline parallelism used on Prefill.\n"
"    `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV cache in Memcache. Both connectors\n"
"    are configured as children of `MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"此配置在 [5.2 节](#dsv4pro-5-2-a3) 的 Atlas 800I A3 部署基础上扩展了\n"
"    Memcache KV Cache Pool。`MooncakeConnectorV2` 将 KV cache 从 Prefill 传输到\n"
"    Decode，并支持 Prefill 上使用的流水线并行。\n"
"    `AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV cache 存储到 Memcache 中。两个连接器\n"
"    都配置为 `MultiConnector` 的子连接器。"

msgid ""
"Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` from [Section 5.2](#dsv4pro-5-2-a3). Set `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` to\n"
"    the `Location` reported by `pip show memcache_hybrid`, and set\n"
"    `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` to the absolute directory containing the configuration\n"
"    files above on all nodes."
msgstr ""
"复用 [5.2 节](#dsv4pro-5-2-a3) 中的 `launch_online_dp.py`。将 `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 设置为\n"
"    `pip show memcache_hybrid` 报告的 `Location`，并将\n"
"    `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` 设置为所有节点上包含上述配置文件的绝对目录。"

msgid ""
"This configuration extends the Atlas 800I A2 deployment in [Section 5.2](#dsv4pro-5-2-a2) with a\n"
"    KV Cache Pool on the Mooncake backend. `MooncakeHybridConnector` transfers KV cache\n"
"    from Prefill to Decode and controls HBM-to-host-memory tiering through\n"
"    `enable_tiered_storage` and `hbm_to_ram_threshold_ratio`.\n"
"    `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV cache in the Mooncake pool with\n"
"    `tiered_pooling_mode: \"async_bypass\"`. Both connectors are configured as children\n"
"    of `MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"此配置在 [5.2 节](#dsv4pro-5-2-a2) 中 Atlas 800I A2 部署的基础上，增加了基于 Mooncake 后端的\n"
"    KV Cache Pool。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 将 KV cache\n"
"    从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，并通过\n"
"    `enable_tiered_storage` 和 `hbm_to_ram_threshold_ratio` 控制 HBM 到主机内存的分层。\n"
"    `AscendStoreConnector` 通过\n"
"    `tiered_pooling_mode: \"async_bypass\"` 将可复用的 KV cache 存储在 Mooncake 池中。两个连接器均配置为\n"
"    `MultiConnector` 的子连接器。"

msgid "Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` from [Section 5.2](#dsv4pro-5-2-a2)."
msgstr "复用 [5.2 节](#dsv4pro-5-2-a2) 中的 `launch_online_dp.py`。"

msgid ""
"This document will show the main verification steps of the model, including "
"supported features, feature configuration, environment preparation, multi-"
"node deployment, accuracy and performance evaluation."
msgstr "本文档将展示该模型的主要验证步骤，包括支持的特性、特性配置、环境准备、多节点部署、精度与性能评估。"

msgid ""
"- `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813`: For Ascend 950DT products, use the original "
"[`DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813`](https://huggingface.co/deepseek-"
"ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813) weights released by DeepSeek on Hugging Face. The "
"Attention weights use MXFP8, while the MoE weights use MXFP4 with 4-bit "
"weights and 8-bit activation computation (W4A8). No Ascend-specific "
"quantization or weight conversion is required. Both the mixed-deployment "
"example in [Section 5.1](#51-multi-node-online-deployment) and the 2P1D "
"example in [Section 5.2](#52-multi-node-pd-separation-deployment) use Ascend"
" 950DT products (96GB × 8) with this checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"- `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813`：对于Ascend 950DT系列产品，请使用 DeepSeek 在 Hugging Face "
"上发布的原始 [`DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813`](https://huggingface.co/deepseek-"
"ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813) 权重。Attention 权重使用 MXFP8，而 MoE 权重使用 MXFP4，采用 4 位权重和 "
"8 位激活计算（W4A8）。无需进行昇腾专用的量化或权重转换。[5.1 节](#51-multi-node-online-"
"deployment)中的混合部署示例和[5.2 节](#52-multi-node-pd-separation-deployment)中的 2P1D "
"示例均使用Ascend 950DT系列产品（96GB × 8）及该检查点。"

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` sets the global number of data parallel ranks, and `--data-parallel-size-local` sets the number of DP ranks on the current node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank` specifies the starting data parallel rank of the current node. Set a unique value on each headless node (e.g., Node1 = 1). On Node0, omit `--data-parallel-start-rank` even when the start rank is 0, to avoid enabling hybrid load balancing with headless remote engines.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` specifies the IP address of the data parallel master node (Node0). It must be consistent across all nodes.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port` is the DP RPC port. Use the same value on all nodes and ensure the port is available.\n"
"- `--tensor-parallel-size` sets the tensor parallel size within each DP rank. Configure it together with the DP sizes according to the deployment topology and available NPUs.\n"
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` configures prefill context parallelism (PCP) on Model Runner V2 (MRv2), which spreads a long prompt across multiple NPUs during prefill. Besides speeding up prefill, enabling PCP also shards the o_proj weights across the PCP group, providing partial tensor parallelism even when `--tensor-parallel-size` is `1`. Since DeepSeek-V4 on 950DT products does not currently support standalone TP, the 950DT DP mixed-deployment uses `DP2/TP1` with PCP `8`, and the o_proj weight sharding also relieves its memory pressure. Do not combine it with `enable_dsa_cp`, which is mutually exclusive with PCP and unsupported by the V2 model runner.\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer.\n"
"- `--headless` (used on non-master nodes) disables the API server on the node, since only the master node serves requests.\n"
"- `--max-model-len` specifies the maximum context length. The example values are intended to allow startup with the documented hardware and configuration. To tune this value, check the startup log `Maximum concurrency for L tokens per request: Cx`: `L × C` provides a rough KV-cache capacity reference for increasing the context length with the same configuration. Use the smallest estimate across all ranks and, for PD-disaggregated deployment, across both Prefill and Decode pools.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` indicates the maximum number of requests that each DP group is allowed to process. If the number of requests sent to the service exceeds this limit, the excess requests will remain in a waiting state and will not be scheduled. Note that the time spent in the waiting state is also counted in metrics such as TTFT and TPOT. Therefore, when testing performance, it is generally recommended that `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= the actual total concurrency.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes more activation memory.\n"
"- `--tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4`, `--tool-call-parser deepseek_v4`, `--enable-auto-tool-choice`, and `--reasoning-parser deepseek_v4` enable the DeepSeek-V4 tokenizer behavior, automatic tool calling, and reasoning-output parsing.\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` indicates that prefix caching is disabled. To enable it, remove this option.\n"
"- `--block-size` sets the KV cache block size. To enable the experimental 4k prefix cache hit support, change it from `128` to `32`.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W4A8 model used in the A2 and A3 configurations. The original DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 weights used on 950DT products do not require this option.\n"
"- `--model-loader-extra-config='{\"enable_multithread_load\": true, \"num_threads\": 128}'` selects the multi-thread weight iterator. `enable_multithread_load` must be a JSON boolean and `num_threads` must be a positive integer.\n"
"- `--safetensors-load-strategy prefetch` is an alternative that warms checkpoint files into the OS page cache before the normal iterator loads them. Do not combine it with multi-thread loading: the default loader rejects `prefetch`, `eager`, or `torchao` when `enable_multithread_load` is `true`. The examples in this document use only multi-thread loading.\n"
"- `--speculative-config` configures speculative decoding. Use `mtp` for the preview MTP checkpoint and `dspark` for the `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` checkpoint. For DSpark, use the value declared by the checkpoint; the example uses 5 speculative tokens, and all ranks must use the same value.\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype` and `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype` set the KV cache data type. The 950DT example uses FP8 KV cache with both options set to `fp8`.\n"
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager enabled. DeepSeek-V4 deployments require this flag; otherwise, the service may OOM during startup.\n"
"- `--async-scheduling` enables asynchronous scheduling to overlap scheduler overhead with model execution.\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables full ACL graph execution in the decode phase.\n"
"- `--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. `enable_npugraph_ex` enables enhanced ACL graph execution, `enable_static_kernel: false` keeps static-kernel compilation disabled, `enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-native CPU binding, `enable_shared_expert_dp` enables data parallelism for shared experts, and `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` overlaps shared expert computation for better MoE throughput. `enable_fused_mc2: 0` disables the Fused MC2 dispatch/combine path.\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL=4096` retains prefix-cache checkpoints every 4096 tokens. It takes effect only when prefix caching is enabled and must be a non-negative multiple of `--block-size`; `4096` matches the DSpark example's block size of `32`."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` 设置全局数据并行 rank 数量，`--data-parallel-size-local` 设置当前节点上的 DP rank 数量。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank` 指定当前节点的起始数据并行 rank。在每个 headless 节点上设置唯一的值（例如 Node1 = 1）。在 Node0 上，即使起始 rank 为 0，也应省略 `--data-parallel-start-rank`，以避免启用与 headless 远程引擎的混合负载均衡。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` 指定数据并行主节点（Node0）的 IP 地址。所有节点上的该值必须保持一致。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 是 DP RPC 端口。所有节点使用相同的值，并确保该端口可用。\n"
"- `--tensor-parallel-size` 设置每个 DP rank 内的张量并行大小。请根据部署拓扑和可用 NPU 将其与 DP 大小一起配置。\n"
"- `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 在 Model Runner V2（MRv2）上配置 prefill 上下文并行（PCP），在 prefill 阶段将长 prompt 分散到多个 NPU 上。除了加速 prefill 外，启用 PCP 还会在 PCP 组内对 o_proj 权重进行分片，即使 `--tensor-parallel-size` 为 `1` 也能提供部分张量并行。由于 950DT 产品上的 DeepSeek-V4 目前不支持独立 TP，950DT DP 混合部署使用 `DP2/TP1` 并配置 PCP `8`，o_proj 权重分片也缓解了其内存压力。请勿将其与 `enable_dsa_cp` 组合使用，后者与 PCP 互斥，且 V2 模型运行器不支持。\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。请勿在同一 MoE 层中混用 MoE 张量并行和专家并行。\n"
"- `--headless`（用于非主节点）禁用该节点上的 API 服务器，因为只有主节点处理请求。\n"
"- `--max-model-len` 指定最大上下文长度。示例值旨在使服务能够在文档所述的硬件和配置下启动。要调整此值，请查看启动日志 `Maximum concurrency for L tokens per request: Cx`：`L × C` 提供了在相同配置下增加上下文长度时的粗略 KV 缓存容量参考。请使用所有 rank 中的最小估计值，对于 PD 分离部署，则使用 Prefill 和 Decode 两个池中的最小估计值。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` 表示每个 DP 组允许处理的最大请求数。如果发送到服务的请求数超过此限制，多余的请求将保持等待状态且不会被调度。请注意，等待状态所花费的时间也会计入 TTFT 和 TPOT 等指标。因此，在测试性能时，通常建议 `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= 实际总并发数。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` 是单个调度步骤中处理的最大 token 数。较大的值可以提高 prefill 效率，但会消耗更多激活内存。\n"
"- `--tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4`、`--tool-call-parser deepseek_v4`、`--enable-auto-tool-choice` 和 `--reasoning-parser deepseek_v4` 启用 DeepSeek-V4 分词器行为、自动工具调用和推理输出解析。\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` 表示禁用前缀缓存。要启用它，请移除此选项。\n"
"- `--block-size` 设置 KV 缓存块大小。要启用实验性的 4k 前缀缓存命中支持，请将其从 `128` 改为 `32`。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` 为 A2 和 A3 配置中使用的 W4A8 模型启用昇腾量化。950DT 产品上使用的原始 DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 权重不需要此选项。\n"
"- `--model-loader-extra-config='{\"enable_multithread_load\": true, \"num_threads\": 128}'` 选择多线程权重迭代器。`enable_multithread_load` 必须是 JSON 布尔值，`num_threads` 必须是正整数。\n"
"- `--safetensors-load-strategy prefetch` 是一种替代方案，它在常规迭代器加载检查点文件之前将其预热到操作系统页缓存中。请勿将其与多线程加载组合使用：当 `enable_multithread_load` 为 `true` 时，默认加载器会拒绝 `prefetch`、`eager` 或 `torchao`。本文档中的示例仅使用多线程加载。\n"
"- `--speculative-config` 配置投机解码。对于预览版 MTP 检查点使用 `mtp`，对于 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813` 检查点使用 `dspark`。对于 DSpark，请使用检查点声明的值；示例使用 5 个投机 token，所有 rank 必须使用相同的值。\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype` 和 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype` 设置 KV 缓存数据类型。950DT 示例使用 FP8 KV 缓存，两个选项均设置为 `fp8`。\n"
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV 缓存管理器启用。DeepSeek-V4 部署需要此标志；否则，服务可能在启动时发生 OOM。\n"
"- `--async-scheduling` 启用异步调度，使调度器开销与模型执行重叠。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 在 decode 阶段启用完整的 ACL graph 执行。\n"
"- `--additional-config` 启用昇腾特有的优化。`enable_npugraph_ex` 启用增强的 ACL graph 执行，`enable_static_kernel: false` 保持静态内核编译禁用，`enable_cpu_binding` 启用昇腾原生 CPU 绑定，`enable_shared_expert_dp` 为共享专家启用数据并行，`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 重叠共享专家计算以获得更好的 MoE 吞吐量。`enable_fused_mc2: 0` 禁用 Fused MC2 dispatch/combine 路径。\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL=4096` 每 4096 个 token 保留一次前缀缓存检查点。它仅在启用前缀缓存时生效，且必须是 `--block-size` 的非负倍数；`4096` 与 DSpark 示例的块大小 `32` 相匹配。"

msgid ""
"2. Prepare the Prefill startup scripts. There is one Prefill instance, a PP2"
" engine spread across 2 nodes: the master node (`--node-rank 0`) starts the "
"engine and its API server, while the worker node (`--node-rank 1`) joins the"
" same engine with `--headless`. `--master-addr` must point to the master "
"node's service IP so that the worker can join the cross-node process group, "
"and both nodes must use identical model, TP, PP, PCP, and "
"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` settings. `--port $1` takes the engine port from "
"the first command-line argument of the script, for example `bash "
"run_p_node0.sh 8000`."
msgstr ""
"2. 准备 Prefill 启动脚本。这里有一个 Prefill 实例，即一个跨 2 个节点部署的 PP2 引擎：主节点（`--node-rank "
"0`）启动引擎及其 API 服务器，而工作节点（`--node-rank 1`）通过 `--headless` 加入同一个引擎。`--master-"
"addr` 必须指向主节点的服务 IP，以便工作节点能够加入跨节点进程组，并且两个节点必须使用相同的 model、TP、PP、PCP 和 "
"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` 设置。`--port $1` 从脚本的第一个命令行参数获取引擎端口，例如 `bash "
"run_p_node0.sh 8000`。"

msgid "1. `run_p_node0.sh` on the master node:"
msgstr "1. 在主节点上运行 `run_p_node0.sh`："

msgid ""
"2. `run_p_node1.sh` on the worker node: use the same content as "
"`run_p_node0.sh` with these changes: set `local_ip` to the IP of this node, "
"keep `node0_ip` as the master node's service IP, change `--node-rank` to "
"`1`, append `--headless` to `vllm serve` so that this node runs only its PP "
"stage without starting an API server, and assign a unique `kv_port`, for "
"example `\"kv_port\":\"30200\"`."
msgstr ""
"2. 在工作节点上运行 `run_p_node1.sh`：使用与 `run_p_node0.sh` 相同的内容，但进行以下修改：将 `local_ip`"
" 设置为本节点的 IP，保持 `node0_ip` 为主节点的服务 IP，将 `--node-rank` 改为 `1`，在 `vllm serve` "
"后追加 `--headless`，使该节点只运行其 PP 阶段而不启动 API 服务器，并分配一个唯一的 `kv_port`，例如 "
"`\"kv_port\":\"30200\"`。"

msgid ""
"4. Start the service in separate terminals on the corresponding machines. "
"Start the Prefill master node before its worker node; the first argument is "
"the engine port passed to `--port $1`."
msgstr ""
"4. 在对应机器的独立终端中启动服务。先启动 Prefill 主节点，再启动其工作节点；第一个参数是传递给 `--port $1` 的引擎端口。"

msgid "1. Prefill master node"
msgstr "1. Prefill 主节点"

msgid "2. Prefill worker node: headless"
msgstr "2. Prefill 工作节点：headless"

msgid "3. Decode node 0"
msgstr "3. Decode 节点 0"

msgid "4. Decode node 1"
msgstr "4. Decode 节点 1"

msgid ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype` keeps the default BF16 KV dtype, and `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` sets the index-side KV dtype to INT8. The P and D sides must use the same KV data types so that the transferred KV cache is directly reusable.\n"
"    - `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank` / `--master-addr` distribute the Prefill engine (`DP1/TP2/PP2`) over 2 nodes with one PP stage per node; the worker node (`--node-rank 1`) runs headless.\n"
"    - `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8` on Prefill; Decode passes `--pcp-size 1` to the launcher, keeping PCP disabled on the Decode pool. Keep `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.pcp_size` and `decode.pcp_size` consistent with the PCP size of the corresponding pool.\n"
"    - `--kv-transfer-config` uses `MooncakeConnectorV2` for KV transfer; it is required because pipeline parallelism is enabled.\n"
"    - `--additional-config`: `enable_flashcomm1: true` and `enable_fused_mc2: 1` enable the Fused MC2 fusion operator with FlashComm to accelerate communication on Prefill nodes."
msgstr ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype` 保持默认的 BF16 KV dtype，`--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` 将索引侧的 KV dtype 设置为 INT8。P 侧和 D 侧必须使用相同的 KV 数据类型，以便传输的 KV cache 可以直接复用。\n"
"    - `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank` / `--master-addr` 将 Prefill 引擎（`DP1/TP2/PP2`）分布到 2 个节点上，每个节点一个 PP 阶段；工作节点（`--node-rank 1`）以 headless 模式运行。\n"
"    - Prefill 上使用 `--prefill-context-parallel-size 8`；Decode 向启动器传递 `--pcp-size 1`，使 Decode 池上的 PCP 保持禁用。保持 `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.pcp_size` 和 `decode.pcp_size` 与对应池的 PCP 大小一致。\n"
"    - `--kv-transfer-config` 使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 进行 KV 传输；由于启用了流水线并行，因此该项为必需。\n"
"    - `--additional-config`：`enable_flashcomm1: true` 和 `enable_fused_mc2: 1` 启用 Fused MC2 融合算子与 FlashComm，以加速 Prefill 节点上的通信。"

msgid ""
"Prepare the Prefill startup scripts. There is one Prefill instance, a PP2 "
"engine spread across 2 nodes: the master node (`--node-rank 0`) starts the "
"engine and its API server, while the worker node (`--node-rank 1`) joins the"
" same engine with `--headless`. `--master-addr` must point to the master "
"node's service IP so that the worker can join the cross-node process group, "
"and both nodes must use identical model, TP, PP, PCP, and "
"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` settings. `--port $1` takes the engine port from "
"the first command-line argument of the script, for example `bash "
"run_p_node0.sh 8000`. Set `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` to the `Location` reported"
" by `pip show memcache_hybrid`, and set `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` to the "
"absolute directory containing the configuration files above on both nodes."
msgstr ""
"准备 Prefill 启动脚本。这里有一个 Prefill 实例，即一个跨 2 个节点部署的 PP2 引擎：主节点（`--node-rank "
"0`）启动引擎及其 API 服务器，而工作节点（`--node-rank 1`）通过 `--headless` 加入同一个引擎。`--master-"
"addr` 必须指向主节点的服务 IP，以便工作节点能够加入跨节点进程组，并且两个节点必须使用相同的 model、TP、PP、PCP 和 "
"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` 设置。`--port $1` 从脚本的第一个命令行参数获取引擎端口，例如 `bash "
"run_p_node0.sh 8000`。将 `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 设置为 `pip show "
"memcache_hybrid` 报告的 `Location`，并将两个节点上的 `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` "
"设置为包含上述配置文件的绝对目录。"

msgid ""
"After the Decode engines are ready, start the Prefill master node before its\n"
"    worker node in separate terminals on the corresponding machines. The first\n"
"    argument is the engine port passed to `--port $1`:"
msgstr ""
"Decode 引擎就绪后，在对应机器的独立终端中先启动 Prefill 主节点，再启动其\n"
"    工作节点。第一个\n"
"    参数是传递给 `--port $1` 的引擎端口："

msgid ""
"Replace `<node0_ip>:<port>` with the IP address and port of the node that "
"serves requests: for the mixed deployment in [Section 5.1](#51-multi-node-"
"online-deployment), use the primary node (Node0) that exposes the API "
"server; for the PD separation deployment in [Section 5.2](#52-multi-node-pd-"
"separation-deployment), use the proxy node instead, since all requests are "
"routed to the Prefill and Decode pools through the proxy."
msgstr ""
"将 `<node0_ip>:<port>` 替换为提供请求服务的节点的 IP 地址和端口：对于[第 5.1 节](#51-multi-node-"
"online-deployment)中的混合部署，使用暴露 API 服务器的主节点（Node0）；对于[第 5.2 节](#52-multi-node-"
"pd-separation-deployment)中的 PD 分离部署，则改用代理节点，因为所有请求都通过代理路由到 Prefill 池和 Decode"
" 池。"

msgid ""
"> **Note**: The following configurations are based on the [Section "
"5](#5-online-service-deployment) deployment examples and specific test "
"environments. They are for reference only and are not globally optimal. In "
"particular, the long-context configuration is a suggested starting point for"
" inputs around 1M tokens and must be validated against the actual "
"input/output length, prefix cache hit rate, concurrency, memory usage, and "
"deployment environment. Refer to [Section 9.2](#92-tuning-guidelines) for "
"further tuning."
msgstr ""
"> **注意**：以下配置基于[第 5 节](#5-online-service-"
"deployment)的部署示例和特定测试环境。它们仅供参考，并非全局最优。特别是，长上下文配置是针对约 1M token "
"输入的推荐起点，必须根据实际的输入/输出长度、前缀缓存命中率、并发数、内存使用情况和部署环境进行验证。进一步的调优请参考[第 9.2 "
"节](#92-tuning-guidelines)。"
